---
// Section: Brand Statement & Philosophy (Inspired by SS3 / Choginga-Record About Art Direction)
---

<section id="about" class="relative w-full py-28 md:py-36 px-6 lg:px-16 bg-[#FAF7F9] dark:bg-void-black border-t border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.06] overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
  
  <!-- Subtle Background Diagonal Speed Lines -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20">
    <div class="w-full h-full" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(209,77,145,0.05) 0, rgba(209,77,145,0.05) 1px, transparent 0, transparent 40px);"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Top Left Section Title (Choginga SS3 Style) -->
    <div data-animate="reveal" class="flex flex-col mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h2 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl text-neutral-950 dark:text-soft-white tracking-wider leading-none">
        ABOUT
      </h2>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-electric-magenta uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>▪▫</span>
        <span>AFTERGLOW // PHILOSOPHY & STORY</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Asymmetric Stage Grid (SS3 Composition) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Manifesto Text & Bracketed Action (5 Cols) -->
      <div data-animate="reveal" class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between order-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-muted-gray leading-relaxed font-normal">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-neutral-950 dark:text-soft-white font-semibold">AFTERGLOW</strong> lahir dari keyakinan bahwa dentuman musik panggung adalah salah satu pengalaman paling murni dalam hidup manusia.
          </p>
          <p>
            Ketika konser selesai dan lampu panggung padam, yang tersisa bukanlah tiket fisik—melainkan resonansi, getaran dada, dan memori yang tak pernah pudar.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-muted-gray/80 pt-2 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-white/10 font-mono">
            Kami menolak sistem calo dan bot yang merusak momen tersebut. Setiap tiket di AFTERGLOW dijamin 100% autentik, terlindungi oleh protokol transaksi berkecepatan tinggi.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Bracketed Button (SS3 Style: [ VIEW DETAILS ]) -->
        <div class="mt-8 pt-4">
          <a 
            href="/events" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-3 border border-electric-magenta/40 bg-electric-magenta/5 hover:bg-electric-magenta/20 text-neutral-900 dark:text-soft-white font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase transition-all duration-300 hover:border-electric-magenta group"
          >
            <span class="mr-4">[ EXPLORE OUR FREQUENCIES ]</span>
            <span class="text-electric-magenta group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Center Column: Iconic Cosmic Burst Emblem (4 Cols) -->
      <div data-animate="reveal" class="lg:col-span-4 flex items-center justify-center order-1 lg:order-2 my-6 lg:my-0">
        <div class="relative w-56 h-56 sm:w-64 sm:h-64 flex items-center justify-center group">
          <!-- Outer Pulsing Glow -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-electric-magenta/25 blur-3xl animate-pulse [animation-duration:4s]"></div>

          <!-- Spiky Burst SVG Emblem (Inspired by Choginga Center Starburst) -->
          <svg class="relative z-10 w-full h-full text-electric-magenta filter drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(209,77,145,0.7)] group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" viewBox="0 0 200 200" fill="none">
            <!-- Center Galaxy Swirl -->
            <path d="M100 15 L112 70 L165 40 L130 90 L185 100 L130 115 L165 160 L115 130 L100 185 L85 130 L35 160 L70 115 L15 100 L70 90 L35 40 L88 70 Z" fill="url(#burstGradient)" stroke="rgba(248,240,245,0.3)" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <!-- Inner Concentric Orbit -->
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="32" stroke="#F8F0F5" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 4" class="animate-spin-slow origin-center" />
            <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="14" fill="#0B090B" stroke="#D14D91" stroke-width="3" />
            
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="burstGradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="200" y2="200" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <stop stop-color="#D14D91" />
                <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#70264F" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#20151D" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
          </svg>

          <!-- Center Typographic Monogram -->
          <span class="absolute z-20 font-display text-2xl text-soft-white font-bold select-none pointer-events-none">
            AG
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Grand Vertical Typography / Tategaki (3 Cols) -->
      <div data-animate="reveal" class="lg:col-span-3 hidden lg:flex justify-end items-center order-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
          <div class="h-64 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-neutral-300 dark:via-white/20 to-transparent"></div>
          
          <!-- Vertical Manifesto Characters -->
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span class="text-3xl font-display tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-950 dark:text-soft-white select-none" style="writing-mode: vertical-rl;">
              MUSIC FADES.
            </span>
            <span class="text-3xl font-display tracking-[0.2em] text-electric-magenta select-none font-bold" style="writing-mode: vertical-rl;">
              MEMORIES DON'T.
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-neutral-500 dark:text-muted-gray/60 select-none pt-2" style="writing-mode: vertical-rl;">
              残光 • 永遠の記憶
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
